    <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234> dct:title "A theory of biological pattern formation" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(79)90042-0> dct:title "Simple chemical reaction systems with limit cycle behaviour" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1083/jcb.29.2.223> dct:title "The development of pigment granules in the eyes of wild type and mutant Drosophila melanogaster" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1093/aesa/9.4.323> dct:title "Notes on North American Drosophilidae with Descriptions of Twenty-Three New Species" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.129.8.1849> dct:title "Reciprocal functions of the Drosophila Yellow and Ebony proteins in the development and evolution of pigment patterns" .
